WEBVTT

1
00:00:13.293 --> 00:00:15.294
next morning we went rowing on the lake.

2
00:00:16.635 --> 00:00:18.997
Then we played games in the Lake Lounge.

3
00:00:19.017 --> 00:00:22.939
"It's time to pack up and go home," said Mr.

4
00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:24.040
Chen after lunch.

5
00:00:25.241 --> 00:00:26.102
Jenny moaned.

6
00:00:26.122 --> 00:00:29.104
"Do we have to leave so soon?"

7
00:00:30.068 --> 00:00:31.749
"We've had so much fun here!"

8
00:00:32.169 --> 00:00:32.869
said Josh.

9
00:00:34.129 --> 00:00:35.570
I knew how Josh felt.

10
00:00:36.310 --> 00:00:39.151
We'd had a wonderful time at Shadow Lake Lodge.

11
00:00:42.252 --> 00:00:45.232
And there were so many more things I still wanted to do.

12
00:00:45.252 --> 00:00:48.593
"I want to go fishing," I said.

13
00:00:48.613 --> 00:00:52.595
"I want to go swimming in the lake," Molly added.

14
00:00:52.615 --> 00:00:57.076
"It's a little cold to go swimming," said Jenny.

15
00:00:58.808 --> 00:01:00.829
"But I want to collect fall leaves.

16
00:01:01.309 --> 00:01:03.711
We don't have all these trees in the city."

17
00:01:03.731 --> 00:01:08.033
"I'd like to explore the lookout tower again," said Josh.

18
00:01:08.053 --> 00:01:11.035
"Me too," said Caswell.

19
00:01:11.055 --> 00:01:14.017
"Maybe there's a hidden treasure there."

20
00:01:14.037 --> 00:01:20.340
"The hotel also has horses," said Molly.

21
00:01:20.360 --> 00:01:22.922
"We could go horseback riding."

22
00:01:22.942 --> 00:01:26.204
"We've had a lot of fun," said Mr.

23
00:01:26.264 --> 00:01:28.665
Chen. "But it's time to go.

24
00:01:29.106 --> 00:01:31.368
Remember, I have to look for a new job."

25
00:01:32.529 --> 00:01:33.970
Josh's face fell.

26
00:01:33.990 --> 00:01:36.973
"I forgot about that," he said.

27
00:01:36.993 --> 00:01:38.974
I had forgotten too.

28
00:01:39.775 --> 00:01:41.857
Now I felt bad, thinking about Mr.

29
00:01:41.957 --> 00:01:43.518
Chen losing his job.

30
00:01:43.538 --> 00:01:49.804
"I hope we don't have to move to Ohio," said Josh.

31
00:01:51.526 --> 00:01:53.768
"That would be awful," I said.

32
00:01:54.988 --> 00:01:57.609
"Let's not think about it," said Jenny.

33
00:01:58.570 --> 00:01:59.930
We went upstairs to pack.

34
00:02:01.951 --> 00:02:05.873
As soon as we opened the door, Bunch started barking at the red curtains.

35
00:02:07.853 --> 00:02:10.294
Everyone else started sniffing the air.

36
00:02:10.314 --> 00:02:15.056
"Something smells funny in here," said Molly.

37
00:02:16.217 --> 00:02:16.817
I nodded.

38
00:02:17.578 --> 00:02:19.238
Something did smell weird.

39
00:02:19.258 --> 00:02:23.160
"It smells like something rotten," added Josh.

40
00:02:24.156 --> 00:02:26.697
"Let's find out where it's coming from," Mr.

41
00:02:26.758 --> 00:02:27.478
Chen said.

42
00:02:29.739 --> 00:02:31.020
We all started looking.

43
00:02:32.160 --> 00:02:34.161
Jenny and Caswell looked in the closet.

44
00:02:35.362 --> 00:02:36.122
Josh and Mr.

45
00:02:36.203 --> 00:02:37.863
Chen searched under the couch.

46
00:02:39.504 --> 00:02:42.926
I looked behind the bathroom door, and Molly looked under her bed.

47
00:02:42.946 --> 00:02:45.067
"Oh my gosh!"

48
00:02:45.547 --> 00:02:46.148
she cried.

49
00:02:46.168 --> 00:02:50.330
"Look!" We all went over and looked under the bed.

50
00:02:51.451 --> 00:02:53.352
All of us except Caswell.

51
00:02:55.072 --> 00:02:56.333
He hid in the closet.

52
00:02:57.893 --> 00:03:00.654
Molly pulled out Caswell's teddy bear backpack.

53
00:03:02.675 --> 00:03:06.317
It was filled with wilted and smelly vegetables.

54
00:03:06.337 --> 00:03:10.279
"Those are the missing vegetables from the parade!"

55
00:03:10.779 --> 00:03:11.439
said Jenny.

56
00:03:11.459 --> 00:03:15.261
"They don't look very healthy anymore," said Josh.

57
00:03:16.341 --> 00:03:18.482
Mr. Chen shook his head in bewilderment.

58
00:03:18.502 --> 00:03:21.423
"How on earth did they get there?"

59
00:03:21.824 --> 00:03:22.484
he asked.

60
00:03:23.920 --> 00:03:26.822
We all looked at the closet where Caswell was hiding.

61
00:03:26.842 --> 00:03:29.744
"Caswell," called Molly.

62
00:03:29.764 --> 00:03:31.466
"Come out here!"

63
00:03:34.268 --> 00:03:36.009
Caswell came out of the closet.

64
00:03:36.710 --> 00:03:37.890
He was hanging his head.

65
00:03:37.910 --> 00:03:40.873
"Caswell, did you take these vegetables?"

66
00:03:41.373 --> 00:03:42.114
asked Molly.

67
00:03:42.134 --> 00:03:46.337
"I don't like vegetables," said Caswell.

68
00:03:46.357 --> 00:03:50.139
"I was afraid I'd have to eat vegetable soup."

69
00:03:51.844 --> 00:03:53.605
"So you hid them under my bed?"

70
00:03:54.105 --> 00:03:54.846
asked Molly.

71
00:03:55.726 --> 00:03:56.767
Caswell nodded.

72
00:03:56.787 --> 00:04:00.509
"Caswell, that was wrong," said Molly.

73
00:04:00.529 --> 00:04:06.372
"He must have taken them yesterday after we went to the lookout tower," said Jenny.

74
00:04:06.392 --> 00:04:10.634
"He did it when I went to get a blanket from the front desk!"

75
00:04:11.174 --> 00:04:11.795
added Mr.

76
00:04:11.855 --> 00:04:15.317
Chen. "I was only gone for about ten minutes."

77
00:04:15.337 --> 00:04:17.638
"Should we tell Mr.

78
00:04:17.718 --> 00:04:19.619
Scary we found the vegetables?"

79
00:04:20.019 --> 00:04:20.800
I asked Mr.

80
00:04:20.860 --> 00:04:22.657
Chen. Before Mr.

81
00:04:22.697 --> 00:04:24.398
Chen could answer, Mr.

82
00:04:24.458 --> 00:04:26.019
Scary stepped into the room.

83
00:04:26.039 --> 00:04:28.822
"I heard everything!"

84
00:04:29.282 --> 00:04:30.583
the hotel manager said.

85
00:04:31.564 --> 00:04:33.426
He pointed to the wilted vegetables.

86
00:04:33.446 --> 00:04:42.633
"I know who took the I gulped, and so did Molly.

87
00:04:42.653 --> 00:04:47.397
"Caswell didn't mean to spoil the vegetable parade," she said quickly.

88
00:04:47.417 --> 00:04:51.797
"We will be happy to pay for the vegetables," added Mr.

89
00:04:51.877 --> 00:04:53.680
Chen. Mr.

90
00:04:53.760 --> 00:04:55.983
Scary's expression didn't change.

91
00:04:57.065 --> 00:04:59.709
He still stared sternly at us.

92
00:05:00.710 --> 00:05:05.597
I closed my eyes, waiting to hear what he was about to say next.
